# Turtlewatch Atoll - a new island of the library, normal size, with no quest
# A turtle sanctuary on a palm-ringed atoll (Shape 1, tropical): the warden's hut on stilts on the broad south shore, two
# hatchery pens fenced on the east nesting beach, a lookout with a telescope over the west reef, the notice board at the
# north landing - and a lagoon full of turtles and of Raft's finds. A place to wander: the warden's notes, the
# volunteers' boxes, turtles, dolphins and rays.
#
# Built by the recipe player (CIRecipe turtlewatch_atoll) through the editor's own operations. Points: the ring of land at
# about 3.4 m round the lagoon (its floor 3 m down, r ~20); the hut's pad at 0 -30 (3.5 m), the hut x -2..2.5, z -32..-27.5,
# its deck 6.1 m, the ladder at 0.25 -32.1; the pens at 32 8 and 32 -6; the lookout at -32 4; the landing at 3 36.
include lib_huts
include lib_sea
new
gen Trees=0.28 Bushes=0.28 Rocks=0.3 Harvest=0.24 BeachThings=0.3
gen Seed=9113 Radius=45 Height=4 Roughness=0.3 Peaks=1 Shape=1 Style=0 BeachWidth=0.8 Cliffs=0 PeakShape=0.2
gen SeaFloor=0 Shelf=0.5 Seabed=2
gen Water=0.5 SeaRocks=0.35 SeaFinds=0.3 Sunken=0.4 Hostiles=0 Friendly=0 SeaLife=0
generate

# ===== The pads: the hut's on the south shore, the pens' on the east beach, the lookout's, the landing ===================
brush flatten at 0 -30 r=6 s=20 frames=60 h=3.5
brush flatten from 32 -9 to 32 11 r=5 s=20 frames=60 h=3.3
brush sand from 32 -10 to 32 12 r=6 s=20 frames=30
brush flatten at -32 4 r=4 s=20 frames=40 h=3.4
brush flatten at 3 36 r=4 s=20 frames=40 h=3.2
clear at 0 -30 r=7
clear from 32 -10 to 32 12 r=6
clear at -32 4 r=5
clear at 3 36 r=5

# ===== The warden's hut on stilts: his log on a table, the volunteers' supply crate, a hammock of nets ================
push at -2 -32 h=3.5
call stilt_hut y=2.6
place Placeable_Table_Square_Small - at 3.4 3.6 y=2.6 sit
place Note_Book wardenlog at 3.4 3.6 y=3.5 drop yaw=20
place Loot_Crate suppliescrate at 0.9 3.6 y=2.6 sit yaw=10
place FishingNets_02 - at 1 1.2 y=2.6 sit yaw=40
pop
place "Box Small" medicinebox at 4.5 -29 ground sit yaw=20
place RestaSunshadeGround - at -6 -28 ground

# ===== The hatchery pens on the nesting beach: fenced squares of nests, their signs; the egg count on a board =========
macro pen x z sign
line Balboa_DecorationPrefabBase_Fence_Mid from {$x-3} {$z-3} to {$x+3} {$z-3} step=2.98
line Balboa_DecorationPrefabBase_Fence_Mid from {$x-3} {$z+3} to {$x+3} {$z+3} step=2.98
line Balboa_DecorationPrefabBase_Fence_Mid from {$x+3} {$z-3} to {$x+3} {$z+3} step=2.98
place Bird_Nest - at {$x-1.5} {$z-1} ground
place Bird_Nest - at {$x+1.2} {$z-1.5} ground yaw=60
place Bird_Nest - at {$x-0.5} {$z+1.4} ground yaw=120
place Note_Sign $sign at {$x-3.6} {$z+3.4} ground yaw=270
end
call pen 32 8 northpen
call pen 32 -6 southpen
place Note_Board eggcount at 27.5 1 ground yaw=270
place "Box Small" hatcherybox at 27.5 -1.7 ground sit yaw=15

# ===== The lookout over the west reef: a telescope on a stand of planks, the reef notes =================================
push at -32 4 h=3.4
call floors w=2 d=2 y=0.1
place TP_Telescope - at 1.5 1.5 y=0.1 sit yaw=270 scale=0.6
place Note_Sign reefnotes at 3.4 0.4 y=0 sit yaw=90
pop

# ===== The north landing: the welcome board, a box ======================================================================
place Note_Board welcome at 3 37.5 ground yaw=0
place "Box Small" landingbox at 5.5 35 ground sit yaw=30

# ===== Palms round the ring =============================================================================================
for a 30 330 30
place "Pickup_Landmark_Tree_Palm 2" - at {33*cos($a)} {33*sin($a)} ground yaw={$a*2}
place "Pickup_Landmark_Tree_Palm 4" - at {29*cos($a+12)} {29*sin($a+12)} ground yaw=$a
next

# ===== The sanctuary's animals: turtles in the lagoon, dolphins and rays outside; Raft's finds in lagoon and shallows ===
place Creature_Turtle turtles at 0 0 h=-2
place Creature_Dolphin dolphins at 55 -30 h=-3
place Creature_Stingray rays at -55 30 h=-3
call shallows x=0 z=0 r=20 deep=5 n=2 seed=80
call shallows r=60 deep=5 n=1
prop turtles creature.count=4
prop dolphins creature.count=2
prop rays creature.count=2

# --- Things to gather, as suits the island (the user, 2026-10-05): pineapples, mangoes, melons ----------
scatter "Pickup_Landmark_PineappleLandmark" 3 at 0 0 r=31.5 seed=4328 free=3
scatter "Pickup_Landmark_Tree_Mango" 3 at 0 0 r=31.5 seed=4338 free=5
scatter "Pickup_Landmark_WatermelonLandmark" 3 at 0 0 r=31.5 seed=4348 free=3

# ===== Settings, notes, boxes (no quest) =================================================================================
info title=Turtlewatch Atoll
info author=Custom Islands
info description=A turtle sanctuary on a palm-ringed atoll: a warden's hut on stilts, hatchery pens on the nesting beach, a lookout over the reef - and a lagoon full of turtles. No quest: wander, read the warden's notes, help yourself to the volunteers' boxes and dive the lagoon for finds.
island on.arrive=message||A ring of palms round a green lagoon. Something in the water lifts its head, looks at you, and goes back down. A board on the beach says WELCOME.

note welcome Welcome board | TURTLEWATCH ATOLL - SEA TURTLE SANCTUARY\n\nWelcome, visitor. Walk where you like - the turtles have the lagoon, you have the beach.\n\nPlease:\n- don't dig on the east beach (nests!)\n- don't feed anything\n- take what you need from the boxes, leave what you can\n\nThe warden's hut is on the south shore. Knock - he won't answer, he went to the mainland for the season.
note wardenlog Warden's log | WARDEN'S LOG - TURTLEWATCH\n\nNesting season: 31 nests on the east beach, 19 of them in the pens. Two hatched early, at night - I watched them go down the sand to the water like wind-up toys.\n\nThe old female with the notched shell is back in the lagoon, fourth year running. I call her Auntie.\n\nDolphins outside the reef most mornings. Rays on the west shelf - watch your feet.\n\nI'm off to the mainland for supplies. The lagoon looks after itself. Whoever reads this: so can you.\n- Tomas, warden
note northpen North pen | NORTH PEN - nests 1 to 9. Laid in the second week. Due any night now.
note southpen South pen | SOUTH PEN - nests 10 to 19. Do not step over the fence.
note eggcount Egg count board | EGG COUNT\n\nNests: 31 (19 in pens)\nHatched: 2\nLost to crabs: 1\nLost to storms: 0\n\nAuntie seen: Monday, Wednesday, Wednesday again.
note reefnotes Reef notes | WEST REEF - from the lookout\n\nRays on the shelf at low water. Dolphins round the point at dawn. Clams and copper in the shallows if you can hold your breath.
note suppliescrate Volunteers' supply crate | The volunteers' crate: tins, rope, a spare net, a hand trowel for nest marking.
loot suppliescrate Cooked_GenericMeat*2;Rope*3;Plank*4;Nail*6
prop suppliescrate loot.refill=0
note medicinebox Warden's medicine box | Bandages, sun cream, a salve for coral cuts.
loot medicinebox HealingSalve*2;Plastic*2
prop medicinebox loot.refill=0
note hatcherybox Hatchery box | Nest markers, a bucket, a notebook of dates - and a couple of coconuts someone forgot.
loot hatcherybox Coconut*2;Plank*3;Rope*2
prop hatcherybox loot.refill=0
note landingbox Landing box | A box by the board: water for visitors, fruit, a sign-in sheet with three names on it.
loot landingbox PlasticBottle_Water*3;Banana*2;Mango*2
prop landingbox loot.refill=0

save Turtlewatch Atoll
